silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_05_validation_and_shapes_sections_03_path_law_enforcement_concrete_anchor_7#mittenstracefingerprint silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensTraceFingerprint is The trace leg: an observable artifact that fires when the published claim is consumed downstream — a log line saying 'Mittens measurement-leg fetched 2024-04-12 by VetCarePlan_77.'. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TraceLeg', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
